{"id": "t115-001", "text": "Coffee with Simone and Lola. Simone's birthday is next Saturday and she's been going on about a new pair of climbing shoes, size 39. Lola's off to Lisbon on Thursday for a week. Remind me to text Lola the day before to ask if she wants a lift to the airport.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "going on about a new pair of climbing shoes, size 39", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Lisbon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Lola", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-002", "text": "Jack's really into his Warhammer now, painting a whole Ultramarines army. He said the new paint set is too pricey for him. Could be a good one for his birthday in a fortnight.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Warhammer", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ultramarines army", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new paint set is too pricey for him", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-008", "text": "Astrid said the book club's Friday meetup is called off, half of them have flu. Next one probably in a fortnight. She's reading the new Sally Rooney and not loving it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Astrid", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Next one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-014", "text": "Haircut tomorrow at 10. Then gym, then batch cook for the week.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Haircut", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow at 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "batch cook", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t115-015", "text": "Noah got into the county chess squad! Tournament in Leeds next month. His dad Carlos is driving him up the night before. I should send Noah a congrats message.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the county chess squad", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Tournament in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Noah a congrats message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t115-016", "text": "Zara mentioned she collects vinyl, mostly 70s soul and old Motown pressings. Her birthday's Thursday. Record shop on the high street has a Marvin Gaye first pressing, worth a look.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "70s soul", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old Motown pressings", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Marvin Gaye first pressing, worth a look", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-017", "text": "Caught up with Eva and Olivia over brunch. Eva's moving to Bristol at the end of the month, she's sad to leave but the job's too good. Olivia's helping her pack on Saturday. Eva wants a leaving do the Friday before but hasn't sorted a venue.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sad to leave", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Friday before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t115-018", "text": "Sam's doing his driving test on Wednesday morning, third attempt. He's properly anxious. Text him good luck Tuesday night and then ask how it went that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t115-019", "text": "Aaliyah is mad into Formula 1, Ferrari fan since she was a kid. Her brother Hamza thinks it's hilarious. She'd love the Ferrari team cap, keep that in mind for Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Formula 1", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Ferrari", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since she was a kid"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love the Ferrari team cap", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "keep that in mind", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-022", "text": "Mai's son starts nursery on Monday. She's more nervous than he is. Her husband's doing drop off that first morning because she has a meeting.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that first morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t115-025", "text": "Malik's been laid off, found out yesterday. He's putting a brave face on but you can tell he's rattled. His wife's due in March so the timing is awful. Must call him this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "laid off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rattled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-032", "text": "Emil's grandma passed away on Sunday. Funeral's next Friday in Gdansk, he's flying out Wednesday. I'll mind his cat Biscuit while he's gone. Should send flowers to his mum before the funeral.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emil", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "while he's gone", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers to his mum", "owner": "r2", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the funeral", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-037", "text": "Sadia had a scan on Tuesday, all fine. She'd been worrying for weeks but it's all clear now. Her husband took her out for dinner that evening to celebrate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "weeks"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t115-039", "text": "Milan's sister Zara is getting married in June, the hen do is in Ibiza the weekend before. Milan's not invited obviously but he's organising the stag for her fiance Carlos. Big pressure, he's been stressing about it all week. Remind me to ask Milan on Monday if he's booked the paintball.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stag", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiance", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carlos", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Milan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-040", "text": "Lunch with Bao, Noah and Eva. Bao's just finished his MA, graduation's on the 18th. Noah's got a new puppy, a cockapoo called Rolo, and is completely sleep deprived. Eva's training for a triathlon in a fortnight and is swimming every morning. Nice to see them all.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bao", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MA", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new puppy, a cockapoo called Rolo", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "sleep deprived", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "triathlon", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "swimming", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}]}
{"id": "t115-041", "text": "Olivia's play opens next Thursday, she's got the lead. Opening night jitters already. I've got tickets for the Saturday. Should send her a good luck text the day before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got the lead", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Opening night jitters", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a good luck text", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-042", "text": "Sam said Aaliyah is applying to the Royal College of Music, audition is on the 12th. She plays violin, been at it since she was four. She's pretty calm about it apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aaliyah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying to the Royal College of Music", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "audition", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "violin", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since she was four"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty calm", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t115-044", "text": "Weekend plan: Saturday clear out the shed, Sunday farmers market and then finally finish the jigsaw.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weekend"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "clear out the shed", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "farmers market", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "finish the jigsaw", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
{"id": "t115-046", "text": "Talked to Nasser on the phone. His daughter Mai has her GCSE mocks the week after half term and he's worried she's not revising. He's coaching her five a side team on Saturdays too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE mocks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "coaching her five a side team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturdays"}]}
{"id": "t115-047", "text": "Naledi and Aisha are doing a pottery course on Wednesday nights. Aisha made a wonky mug she's weirdly proud of.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery course", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday nights"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly proud", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t115-048", "text": "Malik's wife had the baby! Little girl, Amira, born Saturday morning. Remind me to drop off a meal for them next week and get a card.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Malik", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amira", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off a meal for them", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t115-050", "text": "Alfie's mum is having her hip done next Tuesday. He's taking the week off to look after her. Check in with him midweek.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her hip done", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "midweek", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-051", "text": "Simone plays bass in a ska band, gigs every couple of months. Next one's at the Dublin Castle on Saturday. Her boyfriend Jack does the sound.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Simone", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass in a ska band", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every couple of months"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Next one", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "does the sound", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t115-052", "text": "Gemma's Uncle Reza is retiring after thirty years at the post office. Party is next Saturday. She's making a photo book. Must give her the photos from the summer before Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Reza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring after thirty years at the post office", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Party", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give her the photos from the summer", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t115-056", "text": "Dinner with Shanice and her sister Olivia. Olivia's just got engaged to her girlfriend, they're planning a small wedding next autumn. Shanice is already planning the hen. Their parents are thrilled. Olivia's also in the middle of buying a flat in Leith, completion should be in a fortnight. Need to send Olivia congrats and maybe something for the new flat.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got engaged", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small wedding", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next autumn", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "buying a flat in Leith", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "completion", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Olivia congrats", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olivia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "something for the new flat", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e5", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
